[en.FOCUS_C12_FLYING_SQUADRONS]
Flying Squadrons

[en.FOCUS_C12_FLYING_SQUADRONS_desc]
Whether it’s our trained pilots who have undergone days of training or our brand-new flying machines, all are fully prepared. Finally, we can formally establish our own air force to defend our skies.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FLYING_SQUADRONS]
成立飞行中队

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FLYING_SQUADRONS_desc]
无论是我们已经训练多日的飞行员，还是我们崭新的飞行机器都已经做好了万全准备，我们终于可以正式成立一支属于我们的空军力量来保卫我们的天空

